{
    "_comment": "Tactical Deck Builder Keyword Registry - Updated with Triangle Weaknesses",
    "_triangles": [
        "1. Fire > Ice > Wind > Fire (fire melts ice, ice freezes air, wind fans flames)",
        "2. Fire > Water > Earth > Fire (water quenches fire, earth absorbs water, fire scorches earth)",
        "3. Fire > Water > Thunder > Fire (water douses fire, thunder shocks water, fire overpowers thunder)",
        "4. Nature > Fire > Water > Nature (fire burns nature, water douses fire, water nourishes nature)",
        "5. Metal > Thunder > Earth > Metal (thunder shocks metal, earth grounds thunder, metal is forged from earth)",
        "6. Ice > Fire > Nature > Ice (fire melts ice, nature smothers fire, ice kills plants)",
        "7. Poison > Nature > Ice > Poison (poison kills plants, nature breaks through ice, ice neutralizes poison)",
        "8. Beast > Humanoid > Plant > Beast (beasts hunt humans, humans harvest plants, plants entangle beasts)",
        "9. Light > Undead > Darkness > Light (light destroys undead, undead consume darkness, darkness consumes light)",
        "10. Dragon > Knight > Beast > Dragon (dragons overpower knights, knights slay beasts, beasts overwhelm dragons)",
        "11. Insect > Plant > Fire > Insect (insects devour plants, plants smother fire, fire burns swarms)",
        "12. Warrior > Mage > Assassin > Warrior (warriors rush mages, mages detect assassins, assassins ambush warriors)",
        "13. Knight > Guardian > Assassin > Knight (knights break guards, guardians block assassins, assassins bypass armor)",
        "14. Ranger > Mage > Berserker > Ranger (rangers outrange mages, mages control berserkers, berserkers close on rangers)",
        "15. Monk > Warlock > Paladin > Monk (monks resist dark magic, warlocks corrupt holy power, paladins smite monks)",
        "16. Arcane > Divine > Occult > Arcane (arcane counters faith, divine banishes darkness, occult corrupts arcane)",
        "17. Illusion > Psionic > Blood > Illusion (illusions fool minds, psionics overpower blood, blood breaks illusions)",
        "18. Divine > Necromancy > Blood > Divine (divine purifies undead, necromancy corrupts blood, blood sacrifice corrupts divine)",
        "19. Angel > Demon > Void > Angel (angels smite demons, demons thrive in void, void erases angels)",
        "20. Spirit > Monk > Demon > Spirit (monks exorcise spirits, demons corrupt monks, spirits haunt demons)",
        "21. Engineer > Construct > Thunder > Engineer (engineers control constructs, constructs absorb thunder, thunder fries tools)",
        "22. Shield > Hammer > Sword > Shield (shields block swords, hammers crush shields, swords outmaneuver hammers)",
        "23. Bow > Fist > Dagger > Bow (bows outrange fists, fists overpower daggers, daggers close on archers)"
    ],

